# NAVO Rover/Boat: native physical RC channel 5 mode selector.
# Low -> MANUAL; middle -> AUTO; high -> GUIDED.
# Import explicitly on H743 only after checking actual CH5 PWM and motor isolation.
# This file does not arm, set a current mode, or change throttle/failsafes.
MODE_CH 5
MODE1 0
MODE2 0
MODE3 10
MODE4 10
MODE5 15
MODE6 15
RC5_OPTION 0
